SECTION      | KEY                  | VALUE
----------------------------------------
META         | file_id              | hud
META         | note                 | pc-hq board HUD policy. Read every frame by &.widgits/board-viewer/ops/bv_render_3d.c (bv_draw_hud). Menu-tb "HUD" rows flip the OPT lines via pc_toggle_pdl_opt.sh - live, no rebuild, no restart. See 08-roadmap/design-docs/BV-HUD-TEXT-OVERLAY-AND-MINIMAP.md.

# ── master + per-element switches (0|1) ──
OPT          | hud_enabled          | 1     # master switch - 0 hides everything, frame == pre-HUD
OPT          | hud_coords           | 1     # x y z of camera / possessed entity
OPT          | hud_zlevel           | 1     # current z-slice
OPT          | hud_possess          | 1     # possessed entity id
OPT          | hud_pick             | 1     # entity/voxel under the selector (pieces/display/pick.txt)
OPT          | hud_fps              | 0     # frame rate (off by default)
OPT          | hud_minimap          | 1     # 3D corner minimap

# ── layout ──
KEY          | hud_anchor           | top-right   # top-left | top-right | bottom-left | bottom-right
KEY          | hud_scale            | 1           # integer glyph scale (1 = 8x16 px)
KEY          | minimap_px_per_col   | 8           # px per voxel column
KEY          | minimap_max_px       | 160         # hard cap on minimap width/height (keeps it a small inset)
